{"id":"n67317-2-7","stage":5,"title":"얼버무리다 · 和稀泥","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67317-2-7-1","ko":"엄마, 재료를 다 한군데 담고 나서 어떻게 해요?","zh":"妈妈，把所有食材都放在一起之后要怎么做呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재료를","meaning":"材料","explanation":"재료：材料；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"재료","audio":"/audio/cff206505c96a240e3b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71211","senseId":"1","lemma":"재료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한군데","meaning":"一处","explanation":"한군데：一处","readings":[{"term":"한군데","audio":"/audio/d6e5f1472a6023d1f4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84104","senseId":"1","lemma":"한군데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"담고","meaning":"装，盛","explanation":"담다：装，盛；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"담다","audio":"/audio/41232b29db6bd744f882.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73283","senseId":"1","lemma":"담다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나서","meaning":"做完前面的动作（-고 나다）","explanation":"나다：做完前面的动作（-고 나다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62134","senseId":"1","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"cff206505c96a240","term":"재료","zh":"材料","audio":"/audio/cff206505c96a240e3b0.mp3","entryId":"71211","definition":"用于制造物品的东西。","pronunciation":["재료"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"d6e5f1472a6023d1","term":"한군데","zh":"一处","audio":"/audio/d6e5f1472a6023d1f4da.mp3","entryId":"84104","definition":"指定的一个地方。","pronunciation":["한군데"]},{"id":"41232b29db6bd744","term":"담다","zh":"装，盛","audio":"/audio/41232b29db6bd744f882.mp3","entryId":"73283","definition":"把某物装进器皿里等。","pronunciation":["담ː따"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"做完前面的动作（-고 나다）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62134","definition":"做完前面的动作（-고 나다）","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/56cf0f09cdb0de0c6a54.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67317-2-7-2","ko":"어느 정도 얼버무린 다음에 볶으렴.","zh":"先稍微拌匀一下，然后再炒吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어느","meaning":"什么，多少","explanation":"어느：什么，多少","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62822","senseId":"4","lemma":"어느","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정도","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼버무린","meaning":"和稀泥，草草敷衍","explanation":"얼버무리다：和稀泥，草草敷衍；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"얼버무리다","audio":"/audio/302228cb1adbab4f91d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67317","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼버무리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음에","meaning":"之后","explanation":"다음：之后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"4","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볶으렴.","meaning":"炒","explanation":"볶다：炒；으렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"볶다","audio":"/audio/bb290b67b533b283b839.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59753","senseId":"1","lemma":"볶다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"76e7139b030308e7","term":"어느","zh":"什么，多少","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3","entryId":"62822","definition":"一些、稍微或询问程度、数量时说的话。","pronunciation":["어느"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"表现事物的性质或价值好坏或多少的程度的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]},{"id":"302228cb1adbab4f","term":"얼버무리다","zh":"和稀泥，草草敷衍","audio":"/audio/302228cb1adbab4f91d4.mp3","entryId":"67317","definition":"将多个马虎地搀在一起。","pronunciation":["얼버무리다"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"之后","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"某事结束后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"bb290b67b533b283","term":"볶다","zh":"炒","audio":"/audio/bb290b67b533b283b839.mp3","entryId":"59753","definition":"把几乎没有水分的东西放在火上一边搅拌一边弄熟。","pronunciation":["복따"]}],"audio":"/audio/1ef5778759dbd9b61d76.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.254,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67317","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2"